{"tool_name":"moment-thresholding-(imagej)","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This method allows to compute a threshold that preserves the moments of an image. In ImageJ/Fiji, you can access it in Image-&gt;Ajust-&gt;Threshold and choose Moments in the list. In Aphelion, the tool is in Segmentation-&gt;Threshold-&gt;AphImgMomentThreshold The original paper is 2449</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This method allows to compute a threshold that preserves the moments of an image. In ImageJ/Fiji, you can access it in Image-&gt;Ajust-&gt;Threshold and choose Moments in the list. In Aphelion, the tool is in Segmentation-&gt;Threshold-&gt;AphImgMomentThreshold The original paper is 2449</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-02T20:47:53+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-09T10:08:27+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505209895,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"W. Tsai"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"http://fiji.sc/Auto_Threshold#Moments"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":192,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"15bcd481-0e45-435a-bdd1-7b507165b862","url":"/user/192"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4004,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_segmentation","url":"/image-segmentation"},{"target_id":4046,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_thresholding","url":"/image-thresholding"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d6-45a8-ac32-b321e9bd18f2","url":"/taxonomy/term/4340"}],"has_interaction_level":[{"target_id":3574,"t